  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Kypelon.Pdf 0.2.0-alpha.3: weighted rows with compatible equal Row; per-side flow borders; typed Fixed/Flex rich body cells with atomic pagination; opt-in static TrueType subsetting with full fallback. Thai adapter is non-packable and excluded; default shaping has no real GSUB/GPOS. MuPDF/pypdf extraction differences remain unresolved. Rich Auto columns, rich headers, spans and split rows are unsupported. EdocketReferenceNote is a limited consumer helper. Real office acceptance is pending; Linux, trimming and AOT are unverified. See included README and RELEASE-NOTES.md.",
